@startuml
!include theme.iuml
title Local text preview and explicit human-reviewed collection save
hide footbox
autonumber
actor Member
participant "Imports / EntryEditor\n<<React functions>>" as Web
participant "import_api.preview\n<<route function>>" as API
participant "imports.py\n<<local extraction functions>>" as Extract
participant "collection.py / dataset adapter" as Collection
participant "workspace : WorkspaceStore" as Store

activate Member
Member -> Web : choose a manual transcript/document; Preview
activate Web
Web -> API : POST /api/imports/preview\none file; cookie + Origin + CSRF + project
activate API
note over API : Authenticated context precedes this interaction.\nBound multipart bytes; require exactly one supported file.
API -> Extract : await preview_file(filename, data)
activate Extract
Extract -> Extract : validate extension/size; run _local_preview in thread pool
activate Extract
alt Readable UTF-8 / structured rows / DOCX / text-layer PDF
  note over Extract : Preserve raw text; bound pages/characters/drafts.\nStructured metadata is validated; approval is discarded.
else Unsupported media, image-only PDF or invalid input
  note over Extract : Reject with a local/manual-transcript instruction.\nNo OCR, transcription, generation or remote provider fallback.
end
Extract --> Extract : local text/drafts/warnings or CollectionError
deactivate Extract
Extract --> API : ImportPreview(method=local) or error
deactivate Extract
API --> Web : preview or safe HTTP error; upload resource closed
deactivate API
Web --> Member : inspect exact source text, warnings and candidate fields
deactivate Web

opt Member explicitly saves a reviewed candidate
  Member -> Web : review provenance/wording and Save
  activate Web
  Web -> Collection : POST /api/dataset; validated EntryCreate
  activate Collection
  Collection -> Store : locked read/duplicate check/save via bound adapter
  activate Store
  Store --> Collection : saved row + revision/version, or failure
  deactivate Store
  Collection --> Web : 201 DatasetEntry or actionable error
  deactivate Collection
  Web --> Member : saved only after success; otherwise retain draft
  deactivate Web
end
deactivate Member
legend bottom
  Extraction is local to the application server, not necessarily on-device.
  Preview does not save the original document as an attachment or auto-save entries.
  Imported text is not proof of real fieldwork; the member supplies authenticity and provenance.
  No suggest endpoint or cloud-consent flow remains.
endlegend
@enduml
